When Michael pulls away, they had removed the foam cushioning and that crunch you hear was a special effects sound that they added in poSt.
当迈克尔开车离开时，他们已经移除了泡沫衬垫，你听到的那种嘎吱声是后期添加的特效音。

504
00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:18.120
Well, I thought it was a really relatable moment because I know I've bailed mid-parallel park before.
嗯，我觉得那是一个很有共鸣的时刻，因为我知道我以前也曾在平行停车中途放弃过。

505
00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:23.260
