我也是一样。

516
00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:52.940
Sure, I was doing horribly, but Coach Wolf, who taught me driver's ed, had really worked with me on parallel parking.
当然，我当时表现得很糟糕，但教我驾驶课的沃尔夫教练在平行停车上确实帮了我很多。

517
00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:56.340
My dad had really worked with me on parallel parking.
我爸爸在平行停车上确实帮了我很多。

518
00:23:56.880 --> 00:24:00.680
