上面写了什么？

527
00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:26.640
Very distracted.
非常分心。

528
00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:28.440
Distracted?
分心？

529
00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:36.960
Because when he was giving me my driver's ed test, we drove down the little main street of the small town I'm from.
因为当他给我进行驾驶测试时，我们开车经过了我家乡小镇的主街。

530
00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:40.720
And my friends were all hanging out at this car wash that had gone out of business.
我的朋友们都在一家已经倒闭的洗车店附近闲逛。

531
00:24:41.040 --> 00:24:42.980
People would park their cars there and hang out.
人们会把车停在那里闲逛。

532
00:24:43.060 --> 00:24:43.320
Sure.
当然。

533
00:24:43.460 --> 00:24:44.000
Like teenagers.
就像青少年一样。

534
00:24:44.420 --> 00:24:46.220
And a bunch of my friends were parked there.
我的一群朋友就停在那里。

535
00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:48.300
And they all knew I was taking my teSt.
他们都知道我在参加考试。

536
00:24:48.500 --> 00:24:50.560
And so as I drove by, I honked and waved.
所以我开车经过时，按了喇叭还挥了挥手。

537
00:24:50.820 --> 00:24:51.140
Hmm.
嗯。

538
00:24:51.140 --> 00:24:54.360
And my tester guy did not like that.
我的考官不喜欢那样。

539
00:24:54.600 --> 00:24:56.080
But you still pass.
但你还是通过了。

540
00:24:56.240 --> 00:24:57.880
I still pass because of parallel parking.
我还是通过了，多亏了平行停车。

541
00:24:58.860 --> 00:25:07.280
Well, also arriving this morning to the Scranton Business Park is Ryan and Jim and Pam are walking in.
嗯，今天早上到达斯克兰顿商业园的还有瑞安，吉姆和帕姆正走进来。

