00:44:04.770 --> 00:44:08.890
that's going to happen, which is Ryan watching a video online instead of making the copies
要发生的事情，那就是瑞安在看在线视频，而不是去复印

916
00:44:08.890 --> 00:44:10.090
that Michael has requested.
迈克尔要求他复印的文件。

917
00:44:10.790 --> 00:44:11.270
Yes.
是的。

918
00:44:11.430 --> 00:44:15.710
At 7 minutes, 7 seconds, you can see the video that Ryan is watching.
在7分07秒的时候，你可以看到瑞安正在看的视频。

919
00:44:15.710 --> 00:44:22.850
It was actually a local commercial in Alabama that became very popular on YouTube, and I
那其实是阿拉巴马州的一个当地广告，在YouTube上非常火，我

920
